The '''Fire Eel''' is a {{Rare}} [[Sea Creature]] that can be fished up from Lava on the [[Crimson Isle]].

== Spawning ==
The '''Fire Eel''' can be fished up from any Lava source in the [[Crimson Isle]] with a [[Fishing Rods|Lava Fishing Rod]]. It requires {{Skl|Fishing|XXXIV}} to be fished up.

The base [[Sea Creatures#Sea Creature Weight|Weight]] for the '''Fire Eel''' is {{Green|280}}, resulting in a default catch chance of {{Chance|6.02%|1|16.6|sea creatures}} with all Sea Creatures unlocked. Certain modifiers can be used to increase it:
